Rationale
---------

This service is a thin REST front-end for Lemoine.Cnc.OpcUaClient, which is
itself licensed under the GPL-2.0 only.

The REST contract that is implemented here (the /get, /set and /data requests,
and the shape of their responses) is an interoperability interface. It was
determined from Lemoine.Cnc.CncCoreClient, which is licensed under the
GPL-2.0-or-later, so that the standard CncCoreData and CncCoreGetSet
acquisition modules can talk to this service without any change.

Third party dependencies
------------------------

- OPC UA .NET Standard stack (OPCFoundation.NetStandard.Opc.Ua.*), pulled in by
  Lemoine.Cnc.OpcUaClient. It is dual licensed, one of the two licenses being
  the GPL-2.0.
- Microsoft.AspNetCore / Microsoft.Extensions (MIT), part of the .NET platform.
